        1806
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 2. Restriction on agency personnel actions. No mayoral agency shall hire any personnel or fill a vacancy in any position except upon the written approval of OMB. OMB may approve such action only upon written submission by the agency proposing such action and a determination by OMB that such proposed action is either:",
